# --- Outputs ---------------------------------------------------------------
# All current paper artifacts under outputs/ are TRACKED for now:
#   - outputs/fragmentation_ngram/{raw,figures}/...    (~3 MB)
#   - outputs/fragmentation_transformer/{logs,figures,summary.json}  (~22 MB)
# The .npz per-seed training logs are 200-300 KB each, so keeping them lets
# `scripts/plot_fragmentation_transformer.py` regenerate every figure family
# without retraining.
#
# When the compression_benchmarks experiment lands it will produce large
# binary payloads (compressed files, model checkpoints, audio/image dumps)
# that are NOT worth carrying in git. Add ignore rules HERE at that point,
# e.g.:
#     outputs/compression_benchmarks/raw/**
#     outputs/compression_benchmarks/checkpoints/**
#     *.compressed
#     *.bin.gz
# Until then, leave outputs/ tracked as-is.

# --- Misc scratch ----------------------------------------------------------
outputs/scratch/
outputs/tmp/

# --- wikitext_span_transformer ---------------------------------------------
# Tokenized WikiText-103 (~3.4 GB), regenerated by the prepare stage.
outputs/wikitext_span_transformer/data/
# Per-job SLURM tee logs.
outputs/wikitext_span_transformer/*.log
